{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIxL0ltJTIwTm90JTIwSGltJTIwJTI4MjAyMSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Im Not Him","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/eZ4eXGK93xykzKisem8uxW3GtdU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/abagQeNT6xo9DdNUlPv8recATAB.jpg","description":"Jimmy Valentino has been saved by a miracle - or at least that's what he believes. Given his second chance, Jimmy conveys what he's discovered to other terminally ill patients who, to his astonishment, quickly recover. Jimmy tries to keep his profile and the results of his interventions under the radar but when word spreads, the world converges upon him. A few admire him. Some try to imitate him. Most denounce and disparage what he does as dangerous and sacrilegious. When a patient dies after following what he believes is Jimmy's advice, Jimmy is arrested and prosecuted. With his life in peril once again, Jimmy needs another miracle - one that can't be questioned.\n\nReleased 30 Mar 2021 · US · Language: English · 88 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"3.0","runtime":"88 min","cast":["John Palladino","Annie Heise","Kelly Deadmon","Rocco Sisto","Leigh-Ann Rose"],"director":["Steve Grimaldi"],"released":"2021-03-30T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"You don't choose. You're chosen.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Steve Grimaldi","character":"Director"},{"name":"John Palladino","character":"Jimmy Valentino","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8RuYnm25jh5CXsCa2N4GtqDyyT5.jpg"},{"name":"Annie Heise","character":"Tracy Valentino","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yXQj88QxbJPRrLA65lF4Q6qtTqy.jpg"},{"name":"Kelly Deadmon","character":"Cindy Johnson DA","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7oPdl9xl01gr9A47MonFaj0eTMY.jpg"},{"name":"Rocco Sisto","character":"Judge Lange"},{"name":"Leigh-Ann Rose","character":"Dr. Nicole Allen","photo":"https://image.t